WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:07.790
sometimes bad things horrible things
happen to good people

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:20.910
and I don't I don't know why but life
isn't fair that that's what that's the

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:31.759
reality and disease like cancer in MS
and horrible diseases and accidents and

00:00:31.759 --> 00:00:45.690
these things a good person in the wrong
place in the wrong time can end up just

00:00:45.690 --> 00:01:03.230
a victim of fate and end of reality and
it can be horrible and heart-wrenching

00:01:05.479 --> 00:01:18.810
but when those bad things happen to
people around you what are you going to

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:29.040
do how are you going to lead are you
going to get angry are you going to get

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.759
frustrated are you gonna lash out at
people who are you going to lash out at

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:42.090
anyways are you going to start going
down the spiral of negativity or are you

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:49.380
going to let this horrible situation
dictate the way you feel and the way you

00:01:49.380 --> 00:02:01.670
handle it are you gonna fall over fall
down and fall apart

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:15.430
or or are you going to lead are you
going to face this issue with courage

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:29.270
it was resolution I say lead lead step
up to the challenge be the one that

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:40.970
other people look to absorb that impact
absorb that negativity draw fire draw

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:46.040
fire that's that's what a member of a
platoon for for tactical reasons steps

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:50.750
into the open to draw enemy fire maybe
to give another part of his team the

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:56.360
chance to move or or distract the enemy
but that's what I say draw fire bring

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:09.440
that pain to me I can handle it when
when maybe others cannot and when when

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:17.360
bad things are happening I am going to
try and be the one good thing the thing

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:27.350
standing tall that can be relied upon
because I know that that attitude will

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:41.120
spread it will bolster those around me
and and we will fight and in fighting we

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:51.310
will win and if not the battle and if
not the war we will win because our

00:03:51.310 --> 00:04:03.680
spirit it will never surrender in that
that is the ultimate victory to hold

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:13.750
your head high and even even in the face
of inescapable defeat

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:25.699
to stand and to fight that is the wind

